   "c3_wiki_crypto_item_count_D7": "K4"
  },
  "annotation_disclosure": "the semantic audit behind K1a/K1b/K2/K3/K4 was produced by the AI research agent (H20.1 D7); no human re-annotation; classifiers are not retuned",
